sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant R as CreditController
    participant U as Pay/Consume/ThirdPartyUseCaseImpl
    participant P as CreditPersistencePort
    participant MP as MovementClientPort
    participant W as MovementWebClientAdapter
    participant TS as transaction-service
    participant M as MongoDB

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/credits/{id}/payments  (o /consumptions, /third-party-payments)
    R->>U: execute(...)
    U->>P: findById(id)
    P->>M: findById
    M-->>P: document
    P-->>U: Credit
    U->>U: makePayment(amount) / consume(amount) / thirdPartyPayment(amount)
    Note over U: consume() solo permitido si type=CREDIT_CARD
    U->>P: save(credit)
    P->>M: save
    M-->>P: document
    P-->>U: Credit
    U->>MP: recordMovement(...)
    MP->>W: POST http://transaction-service/api/v1/movements
    W->>TS: (vía Eureka)
    TS-->>W: 201
    W-->>MP: ok
    MP-->>U: ok
    U-->>R: Credit (remainingBalance actualizado)
    R-->>C: 200 OK
